---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Roadmap"
  description="Where Numra is headed: open issues, planned milestones, and stable commitments you can rely on today."
  canonicalPath="/roadmap"
>
  <section class="roadmap">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h1>Roadmap.</h1>

      <p class="lede">
        Numra is pre-1.0. The most accurate signal of upcoming work is
        the
        <a
          href="https://github.com/moussaoutlook/numra-rs/issues"
          rel="noopener"
        >open issues</a>
        and the
        <a
          href="https://github.com/moussaoutlook/numra-rs/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md"
          rel="noopener"
        >CHANGELOG</a>. A long-form quarterly roadmap will land here
        once the project's public release cadence settles.
      </p>

      <h2>What you can rely on today</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Stability commitments.</strong> See
          <a href="/stability">/stability</a> for MSRV, semver, and
          deprecation windows.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Solver behavior in any released version.</strong>
          Covered by the regression suite documented in
          <a
            href="https://github.com/moussaoutlook/numra-rs/blob/main/docs/audit/correctness-test-map.md"
            rel="noopener"
          >docs/audit/correctness-test-map.md</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>License terms.</strong> Free for non-commercial
          academic and research use; commercial use requires a
          separate license. See
          <a href="/license">/license</a>.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How to influence the direction</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/moussaoutlook/numra-rs/issues/new/choose"
            rel="noopener"
          >Open an issue</a> with a use case, a missing solver, or a
          bug.
        </li>
        <li>
          Email
          <a href="mailto:contact@spectralautomata.com?subject=%5BNumra%20feedback%5D%20"
            ><code>contact@spectralautomata.com</code></a>
          with subject prefix <code>[Numra feedback]</code> for
          private input.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .roadmap { padding: var(--space-8) 0; }
  h1 { margin-bottom: var(--space-5); }
  h2 {
    margin-top: var(--space-7);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--color-fg-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  ul { max-width: var(--measure); }
  ul li { margin-block: var(--space-2); }
  code {
    font-size: 0.92em;
    background: var(--color-code-bg);
    padding: 0.05em 0.4em;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }
</style>
